{"id":13726,"artist":"Gene Autry","title":"Here Comes Santa Claus","lyrics_plain":"Here comes Santa Claus,\nHere comes Santa Claus,\nRight down Santa Claus Lane.\nVixen and Blitzen and all his reindeer\nare pulling on the rein.\nBells are ringing, children singing;\nAll is merry and bright.\nHang your stockings and say your pray'rs,\n'Cause Santa Claus comes tonight.\nHere comes Santa Claus,\nHere comes Santa Claus,\nRight down Santa Claus Lane.\nHe's got a bag that is filled with toys\nfor the boys and girls again.\nHear those sleigh bells jingle jangle,\nWhat a beautiful sight.\nJump in bed, cover up your head,\n'Cause Santa Claus comes tonight\nHere comes Santa Claus,\nHere comes Santa Claus,\nRight down Santa Claus Lane.\nVixen and Blitzen and all his reindeer\nare pulling on the rein.\nBells are ringing, children singing;\nAll is merry and bright.\nHang your stockings and say your pray'rs,\n'Cause Santa Claus comes tonight.\nHere comes Santa Claus,\nHere comes Santa Claus,\nRight down Santa Claus Lane.\nHe's got a bag that is filled with toys\nfor the boys and girls again.\nHear those sleigh bells jingle jangle,\nWhat a beautiful sight.\nJump in bed, cover up your head,\n'Cause Santa Claus comes tonight","lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] Here comes Santa Claus,\n[00:01.14] Here comes Santa Claus,\n[00:02.29] Right down Santa Claus Lane.\n[00:04.57] Vixen and Blitzen and all his reindeer\n[00:06.71] are pulling on the rein.\n[00:09.14] Bells are ringing, children singing;\n[00:11.43] All is merry and bright.\n[00:13.71] Hang your stockings and say your pray'rs,\n[00:15.71] 'Cause Santa Claus comes tonight.\n[00:18.29] Here comes Santa Claus,\n[00:19.43] Here comes Santa Claus,\n[00:20.57] Right down Santa Claus Lane.\n[00:22.86] He's got a bag that is filled with toys\n[00:24.86] for the boys and girls again.\n[00:27.43] Hear those sleigh bells jingle jangle,\n[00:29.71] What a beautiful sight.\n[00:32.00] Jump in bed, cover up your head,\n[00:34.00] 'Cause Santa Clau